        "dialogs": {
          "752570901": {
            "id": "752570901",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Let's do this!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7525706",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "752570601"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "752570601": {
            "id": "752570601",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Wait a second."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7525707",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "752570701"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "752570701": {
            "id": "752570701",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Yiztli",
            "text": "Whew, that was the last one! You two really saved the day for me. If not for your help, I might've been inundated with complaints.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "752570702"
            ]
          },
          "752570702": {
            "id": "752570702",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Don't sweat it, hehe. We're the most helpful adventurers ever!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "752570703"
            ]
          },
          "752570703": {
            "id": "752570703",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Yiztli",
            "text": "Adventurers, huh? How about I take a photo of you two? Let's capture that helpful spirit of yours.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "752570704"
            ]
          },
          "752570704": {
            "id": "752570704",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Yiztli",
            "text": "C'mon, smile for the Kamera! An easy-breezy Natlan in an easy-breezy summer!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "752570705"
            ]
          },
          "752570705": {
            "id": "752570705",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Yiztli",
            "text": "Thank you both once again. And take these as thanks, please."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7525701",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "752570101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "752570101": {
            "id": "752570101",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Xoma",
            "text": "Everything here seems to be in working condition. Why isn't it open?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "752570102"
            ]
          },
          "752570102": {
            "id": "752570102",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Yiztli",
            "text": "Ah, my apologies. Unfortunately, our set decorator got a little too tipsy last night and couldn't make it to work today. Would you mind dropping by tomorrow instead?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "752570103"
            ]
          },
          "752570103": {
            "id": "752570103",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Xoma",
            "text": "Oh dear, I'm too old to drag these aching bones all the way back here tomorrow.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "752570104"
            ]
          },
          "752570104": {
            "id": "752570104",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Inti",
            "text": "Not to mention, we've already got plans for tomorrow.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "752570105"
            ]
          },
          "752570105": {
            "id": "752570105",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Yiztli",
            "text": "I'm so sorry. The whole idea of this Summer Photo Booth is to give each customer their own personalized photo background.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "752570106"
            ]
          },
          "752570106": {
            "id": "752570106",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Yiztli",
            "text": "But without our set decorator, we just can't make it happen.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "752570107"
            ]
          },
          "752570107": {
            "id": "752570107",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Need a hand?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "752570108"
            ]
          },
          "752570108": {
            "id": "752570108",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Yiztli",
            "text": "Really? You two are willing to help? That would be amazing! It's not complicated at all — just set up the photo backgrounds based on our customers' requirements."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7525703",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "752570301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "752570301": {
            "id": "752570301",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Yiztli",
            "text": "That last one turned out great! Next up is this strapping Fatuus. What kind of photo did you have in mind?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "752570302"
            ]
          },
          "752570302": {
            "id": "752570302",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Wechtekah",
            "text": "Please make me look like a sharpshooter. Y'know, one glance and people will know I never miss.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "752570303"
            ]
          },
          "752570303": {
            "id": "752570303",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Wechtekah",
            "text": "That way, it won't matter so much when I rank near the bottom in company marksmanship contests.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "752570304"
            ]
          },
          "752570304": {
            "id": "752570304",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Yiztli",
            "text": "You got it. Let's get started!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7525708",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "752570801"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "752570801": {
            "id": "752570801",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Yiztli",
            "text": "That last one turned out great! Finally, we have this dashing young man. What kind of photo did you have in mind?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "752570802"
            ]
          },
          "752570802": {
            "id": "752570802",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Inti",
            "text": "Why, thank you for the compliment. My whole life, I've valued good bearing and grace above all else.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "752570803"
            ]
          },
          "752570803": {
            "id": "752570803",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Inti",
            "text": "Without good bearing, one lacks elegance — and without grace, one lacks refinement. I'm sure you understand my requirements.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "752570804"
            ]
          },
          "752570804": {
            "id": "752570804",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Yiztli",
            "text": "Hmm... Gimme a sec... Got it, let's get started!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
